WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
- You know, I had a kid
write me a letter once,

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.670
he said, "Dear Mr. Leno," he was about 12,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.852
he said, "I told my
friends you're my uncle,

00:00:07.852 --> 00:00:11.580
and on Sundays we go for
rides in your Lamborghini,"

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.840
and he goes on this whole thing.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.673
- What?
- He said,

00:00:13.673 --> 00:00:18.000
"Could you pick me up at my
house and gimme a ride to school

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.220
so my friends won't know I'm a liar."

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.530
- Oh, but you are.
- I said, but you are,

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.910
but you are a liar.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.320
You are a liar.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.110
But then, I just love the
fact he wrote me a letter.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.340
So I called his parents

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.910
and I said, listen, when an
old guy picks up your kid

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.650
in a Italian car?

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:35.700
- Yeah, yeah, that's not okay.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.470
- I said your son wants me
to give him a ride to school.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.303
It's okay.

00:00:38.303 --> 00:00:39.930
So I go to the house, I pick him up,

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.160
we pull up to the school, you know

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.172
the Lamborghini's got the
doors that come up like this.

00:00:43.172 --> 00:00:44.850
He goes, "Bye Uncle Jay."

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.350
I go, "Okay, I'll see you later."

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.900
As I pull, I hear a kid go,
"He really is his uncle."

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.596
Now I'm like, oh, what a liar I am.

00:00:50.596 --> 00:00:52.688
- What did I just do?

00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:53.521
- Yeah, exactly.

00:00:53.521 --> 00:00:55.083
- You're complicit.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.630
- I am complicit in
this child, yeah, yeah.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:58.463
- Yeah.

00:00:58.463 --> 00:00:59.580
- He's now in federal prison.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.780
I don't know what happened
to the kid though.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.313
- I'm sure. (laughs)

